  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Component 7 - Non Partner - Americas CEA support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposal adds to the IFRC-NLRC proposal with crucial data &amp; digital activities, incorporating lessons learned from the NLRC support that was provided in 2022 while building on the main goal formulated in the current IFRC proposal: to provide National Societies with tools to establish long-term and sustainable processes and services as well as strengthening regional coordination mechanisms to enhance coherence and information management efforts. Our data &amp; digital contribution will focus on National Society development that will promote innovative services, most notably for digital Community Engagement and Accountability (CEA) by supporting the Red Data initiative, facilitating access to information, meaningful participation and coordinated feedback mechanisms along the routes.</narrative>
  </description>
